<title>USA: Berman group lifts Motorcar Parts stake.</title>
<headline>Berman group lifts Motorcar Parts stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by investor Merrill Berman said it raised its stake in Motorcar Parts &amp; Accesories Inc to 7.42 percent or 362,000 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought 58,000 shares of Motorcar Parts between August 22 and September 20 at prices ranging from $11.625 to $12.625 a share.</p>
</text>
